{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-10-18 12:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE AND NVIDIA PARTNER TO SPEED AI ADOPTION FOR ENTERPRISES', 'text': 'ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE GETS SUPERCHARGED WITH MAJOR GPU EXPANSION SUPPORTING FULL STACK OF NVIDIA AI SOFTWARE AND SERVICES LAS VEGAS , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE\xa0CLOUDWORLD --\xa0EXPANDING THEIR LONGSTANDING ALLIANCE, ORACLE AND NVIDIA TODAY ANNOUNCED A MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP TO HELP CUSTOMERS SOLVE BUSINESS CHALLENGES WITH ACCELERATED COMPUTING AND AI.\xa0THE COLLABORATION AIMS TO BRING THE FULL NVIDIA ACCELERATED COMPUTING STACK — FROM GPUS TO SYSTEMS TO SOFTWARE — TO ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE (OCI).'}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-10-18 08:10:00', 'title': 'MELISSA & DOUG PLAYS TO WIN WITH ORACLE CLOUD', 'text': 'TECH-FREE TOYMAKER AUTOMATES BUSINESS AND IT PROCESSES TO REDUCE COSTS, INCREASE EFFICIENCY, AND MEET INCREASING GLOBAL DEMAND FOR IMAGINATIVE PLAY LAS VEGAS , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MELISSA & DOUG, A LEADING PRESCHOOL BRAND FOR SUSTAINABLE WOODEN TOYS, HAS SELECTED ORACLE CLOUD TO SCALE ITS GLOBAL OPERATIONS AND TRANSFORM ITS CORE BUSINESS PROCESSES. WITH ORACLE FUSION CLOUD APPLICATIONS SUITE, ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE, AND ORACLE AUTONOMOUS DATABASE, MELISSA & DOUG HAS BEEN ABLE TO REDUCE COSTS, INCREASE EFFICIENCY, ENHANCE OPERATIONAL INSIGHTS, AND SUPPORT ITS RAPID GROWTH BY AUTOMATING END-TO-END BUSINESSES PROCESSES.'}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-10-18 08:09:00', 'title': 'HSBC PARTNERS WITH ORACLE TO ACCELERATE TECHNOLOGY TRANSFORMATION', 'text': "MULTINATIONAL BANKING GROUP SELECTS ORACLE EXADATA CLOUD@CUSTOMER TO SIMPLIFY OPERATIONAL MANAGEMENT AND LEVERAGE CLOUD AUTOMATION LAS VEGAS , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ORACLE CLOUDWORLD -- ORACLE AND HSBC, ONE OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST FINANCIAL SERVICES ORGANIZATIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC COLLABORATION TO ACCELERATE THE BANK'S DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION. \xa0 UNDER THE MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT, HSBC WILL UPGRADE AND MIGRATE\xa0SELECT